// Marine legs. P0 swaps forward/lifted and rear/planted feet between sides.
// Stack: second exit flag, second pose, first exit flag, first pose.
LOADP:0 JUMPIF phase_one
1 0 0 1
1 JUMPIF pose
phase_one:
1 1 0 0
pose:
JUMPIF forward
// Lower-leg coordinates, stacked in reverse drawing order.
26 3 38
19 2 23
25 7 38
20 5 36
25 10 37
20 5 32
26 10 35
19 3 23
22 19 32
20 12 30
24 25 34
20 22 33
22 23 30
22 19 29
21 11 28
21 9 27
1 JUMPIF draw
forward:
26 5 44
19 4 29
25 9 44
20 7 42
25 12 43
20 7 38
26 12 41
19 5 29
22 19 38
20 12 36
24 25 40
20 22 39
22 23 36
22 19 35
